A||||7||Syrin||What can i do to my 86 GT?||||1||
Z||000000||Syrin||12-08-2001||03:00 PM||||First im kinda curious to how hard it is to replace transmissions on these and also you know how the fiero had a 4 spd and a 5spd...is it possibleto take out a 4spd and put in a 5spd with no problems?<P>Also how much does a v8 kit cost?<P>where can i get some tail light mods?<P>And where kind i find body mods? IE: Body Kits, inudction hoods and ect...||||reg||1
Z||000001||Oreif||12-08-2001||03:12 PM||||Swapping between a 4-spd and a 5-spd isn't too hard. Just need the trans, shift cables, and the lower part of the shifter.<P>V-8 kits can cost anywhere from $2000 up to $10,000. $2000 is the basic install kit and $10,000 is everything installed. Depending on what you want determines cost.<BR>Go to:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.v8archie.com" TARGET=_blank>www.v8archie.com</A>  for V-8 installs and some body kits.<P>Just do a search for "taillights" there are a few folks here making different kits. You can do the same for hood and decklid scoops. <P>------------------<BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">            <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><B><I>Happiness isn't around the corner...<BR>Happiness IS the corner.</I></B></FONT><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 12-08-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||GTFiero1||12-08-2001||03:12 PM||||for the V8 there is only one answer: <A HREF="http://www.v8archie.com" TARGET=_blank>www.v8archie.com</A>     for other stuff there is <A HREF="http://www.thefibersmith.com" TARGET=_blank>www.thefibersmith.com</A>   and  <A HREF="http://www.fierostore.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fierostore.com</A>    and tons more that im sure people will post<P>------------------<BR>Adam J. B.<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero_3.jpg">   <BR>you gotta keep on keepin on...<BR>IM AOL: GTFiero &  Rumpdetective (dont ask)||||reg||1
Z||000003||85 gt fiero||12-08-2001||03:17 PM||||if you never replaced a tranny look forward to a 4-9 hour experience, contact archie in this forum for v8 conversion kits, i beleive you can swap trannys without serious troubles, and last body mods there are Rodney Dickerman, Ausfiero, f.o.o.c.a., pisa, and so on there are a ton of ppl on this forum who make body mods.  Randy<P>------------------<BR>RALLY CAR, FULL ROLL CAGE, SKID PLATES, LIGHT BARS, SCS SUSPENSION, KONI ADJUSTERS,HIGH POINT CUTOFFS, AND BRIGHT YELLOW||||reg||1
